WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
The starting amount is c, and the rate is m.

2
00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:08.752
A taxi costs four dollars to get in, before you go anywhere: that is c.

3
00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:19.817
Then two dollars for each kilometre: that is the rate, m.

4
00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:28.372
Together, T equals two d plus four: start at four, up two per kilometre.
